# A chat's file downloaded by the core (MBUI_FIXTURE=chat-download, downloads_fixture.mbt): 发布包.zip opened from its
# card, 下载 asked; the preview closed while it comes, its card saying how far (a ring in its mark's place), kept once
# all of it is here.
timeout 20000
until 发布包.zip
wait 600
tap 发布包.zip
until =下载
wait 800
tap =下载
wait 1200
back
wait 4500
